        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Tonka; 101 Dalmatians (1996 film)\n- Companies: Walt Disney\n- Events: Battle of the Little Bighorn\n- Works: The Hundred and One Dalmatians\n\nFacts:\n- Tonka is a 1958 Walt Disney Western adventure film about a U.S. cavalry horse that survived the Battle of the Little Bighorn.\n- Dodie Smith published the 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- Walt Disney released an animated film adaptation of The Hundred and One Dalmatians in 1961.\n- 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Walt Disney's 1961 animated adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.",
